{"title":"Pi island","slug":"Pi_island","hero":{"file":"Tutorial_Island.webp","width":400,"height":200},"pageid":2787,"revid":22043,"timestamp":"2026-07-08T00:13:37Z","lastEditor":"Eggnog the idiot","categories":["Locations"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Purpose","value":"Obtaining Gigantic Moai"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.54.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Also known as <i>Tutorial Island</i>, Pi Island contains ruins and huge chunks of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lightslate/\">Lightslate</a> that are the biggest rocks that can be found in-game. The rocks unlike normal ones found on the mainland don't have any ores. The location is found roughly to the south-east of the beaches of the deserts of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater_Island/\">Ferwater Island</a>. With the desert revamp changing its locations, it is highly recommended to use vehicles rather than swimming all the way there, and using the Refined Scuba Tank to drive underwater.\nOn the center of the island spawns one <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/GIGANTIC_MOAI/\">GIGANTIC MOAI</a>, which will only respawn after an 1-2 hour, though it is recommended to use a private/solo server as the moai has no owner when it first spawns, meaning others can take and/or claim it.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A big chunk of  in Easter Island\">A big chunk of  in Easter Island</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A big chunk of  in Easter Island\">A big chunk of  in Easter Island</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Captura_de_tela_2024-07-25_212716.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>A big chunk of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Electrified_Rock/\">electric stone</a> in Easter Island</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>\nIt's possible to use the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Michael's_Copper_Axe/\">Michael's Copper Axe</a> to transform the chunks of Lightslate into <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Electrified_Rock/\">Electrified Rock</a>.<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/894303481421262923/1215061614076760126\">[1]</a></p><div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"7b844647134ab1d410b169ea1e81f656\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Nameless_island-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Nameless_island.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Front view of the island.\">Front view of the island.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Front view of the island.\">Front view of the island.</span></a></div></div><div>Front view of the island.</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Stone_PI-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Stone_PI.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: An arch found on the island in the shape of a Pi symbol. Note that while there are other arches, this is the only one shaped as such.\">An arch found on the island in the shape of a Pi symbol. Note that while there are other arches, this is the only one shaped as such.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: An arch found on the island in the shape of a Pi symbol. Note that while there are other arches, this is the only one shaped as such.\">An arch found on the island in the shape of a Pi symbol. Note that while there are other arches, this is the only one shaped as such.</span></a></div></div><div>An arch found on the island in the shape of a Pi symbol. Note that while there are other arches, this is the only one shaped as such.</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Lightslate_on_nameless_island-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Lightslate_on_nameless_island.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: A player next to a Lightslate rock found on the island.\">A player next to a Lightslate rock found on the island.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: A player next to a Lightslate rock found on the island.\">A player next to a Lightslate rock found on the island.</span></a></div></div><div>A player next to a Lightslate rock found on the island.</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Easter_Island_location-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Easter_Island_location.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The relative location of Easter Island compared to the two main islands.\">The relative location of Easter Island compared to the two main islands.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The relative location of Easter Island compared to the two main islands.\">The relative location of Easter Island compared to the two main islands.</span></a></div></div><div>The relative location of Easter Island compared to the two main islands.</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Large_Magnetite-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Large_Magnetite.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: A player finding a large piece of Magnetite in the Lightslate on Easter Island.\">A player finding a large piece of Magnetite in the Lightslate on Easter Island.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: A player finding a large piece of Magnetite in the Lightslate on Easter Island.\">A player finding a large piece of Magnetite in the Lightslate on Easter Island.</span></a></div></div><div>A player finding a large piece of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Magnetite/\">Magnetite</a> in the Lightslate on Easter Island.</div></div><div><div><div id=\"2560743343_9938675423_1722977485453-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/2560743343_9938675423_1722977485453.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The direction relative to the path to Pi island. (This is the stone arch on Finlay Island for those confused.)\">The direction relative to the path to Pi island. (This is the stone arch on Finlay Island for those confused.)</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The direction relative to the path to Pi island. (This is the stone arch on Finlay Island for those confused.)\">The direction relative to the path to Pi island. (This is the stone arch on Finlay Island for those confused.)</span></a></div></div><div>The direction relative to the path to Pi island. (This is the stone arch on Finlay Island for those confused.)</div></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>Easter Island was first introduced as a tutorial place, hence its other name <i>Tutorial Island</i>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Magnetite/\">Magnetite</a> was once found in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lightslate/\">Lightslate</a> that spawns on the island. This can still occur as of 7/7/2026.</li></ul>","alias":{"of":"Easter Island","slug":"Easter_Island"}}
